- [ ] Tasks always reschedule (even on failure)
- [ ] Security vulnerabilities addressed (input validation, data exposure)
- [ ] Performance considerations implemented (caching, OCR optimization)
- [ ] Error handling properly implemented (ADB exceptions, OCR failures)
- [ ] Testing coverage adequate (>80% for business logic)
- [ ] Code style consistent (naming, structure, patterns)
